<LANGUAGE>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_00_03_apartment2">
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_001_Player_001">Hello.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_002_David_001">Hi, Simon. This is David Munshi. How are you? We spoke the other day about doing a scan.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_003_Player_001">Yes, I remember. How are things?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_004_David_001">Sorry I haven&apos;t found anything earlier, getting time in the labs is just insane.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_005_David_001">Anyhow. Calling on the off chance that you have time today. I know it&apos;s--</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_006_Player_001">I can come.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_007_David_001">Really? That&apos;s great. Come by as soon as you can. You have the address, right?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_008_Player_001">I have it. Should I drink the tracer?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_009_David_001">Oh, Dr Peake gave you some? Yeah, do that. Saves us some time. Come by as soon as you can.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_010_Player_001">See you soon.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_5_FoundTracer_001_Player_001">There it is.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_6_DrinkTracer_001_Player_001">It feels like milk, but the taste -- like sucking on a penny.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_7_BrokenShower_001_Player_001">Don&apos;t want to keep the doctor waiting. I&apos;ll shower when I get back.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_8_OpenDrapes_001_Player_001">Summer is coming. I hope it&apos;s a good one.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_9_InspectFridge_001_Player_001">Nothing but fast food. I should buy something healthier on my way home.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_001_Jerry_001">Hi, it&apos;s Ash. Did you fall off the earth or something? It scares me that you won&apos;t talk to me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_001_Jerry_002">I&apos;m driving into Toronto later today. If you want I could come by. Call me, okay?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_002_AnswerMachine_001">End of messages.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_003_Player_001">I guess I should call her. I&apos;ll do it on my way to the scan.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_11_UseTV_001_Player_001">It&apos;s a strange feeling, both wanting and not wanting to hear about the crash. I&apos;d better leave it off.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_12_TryToExit_001_Player_001">I really should drink the tracer fluid before I go and see Dr Munshi.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_13_TracerReminder_001_Player_001">Where did I put the tracer fluid?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_0_LevelIntro_001_Player_001">It&apos;s an experiment. They want me to try some new thing.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_0_LevelIntro_002_Jerry_001">That sounds really scary.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_0_LevelIntro_003_Player_001">Yeah, I guess it does.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_13_TracerReminderB_001_Player_001">Come on, radioactive tracer fluid. Where did I put you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_13_NoNewMessages_001_AnswerMachine_001">You have no new messages.</Entry>
    </CATEGORY>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_00_01_apartment">
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_001_Player_001">I&apos;m up.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_002_David_001">Hi, Simon Jarret?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_003_Player_001">Yeah, that&apos;s me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_004_David_001">My name is David Munshi. We spoke earlier -</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_005_Player_001">The brain scan, I remember.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_006_David_001">Are you all right?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_007_Player_001">Just a bad dream. Are we still on for today?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_008_David_001">Yeah, that&apos;s why I&apos;m calling. I wanted to remind you to drink the tracer fluid I sent you. It will help me capture a better image of the damages.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_009_Player_001">Don&apos;t worry, I got it somewhere.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_010_David_001">Okay, great. See you in a couple of hours then.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCall_011_Player_001">See you soon.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_5_FoundTracer_001_Player_001">There it is.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_6_DrinkTracer_001_Player_001">Feels like milk, but the taste - like sucking on a penny.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_7_BrokenShower_001_Player_001">Don&apos;t want to keep the doctor waiting. I&apos;ll shower when I get back.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_8_OpenDrapes_001_Player_001">Summer&apos;s coming. Hope it&apos;s a good one.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_9_InspectFridge_001_Player_001">Nothing but fast food. Should buy something healthier on my way home.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_001_Jerry_001">Hey, Simon. It&apos;s Jesse! Are you working this weekend or what?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_001_Jerry_002">I know there was some thing you were doing - was it this weekend or next?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_001_Jerry_003">Anywho, just shoot me a mail or something. Loveyoumissyoumeanit!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_002_AnswerMachine_001">End of messages.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_10_AnswerMachine_003_Player_001">I swear that guy has the memory of a gold fish.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_11_UseTV_001_Player_001">Right, watching TV gives me headaches now. Thank you, brain.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_12_TryToExit_001_Player_001">I really should drink the tracer fluid before I go and see Dr Munshi.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_13_TracerReminder_001_Player_001">Where did I put the tracer fluid?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_13_TracerReminderB_001_Player_001">Come on, radioactive tracer fluid. Where are you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="AnswerMachine_13_NoNewMessages_001_AnswerMachine_001">You have no new messages.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Phonecall_1_PhoneCallOver_001_Player_001">...christ... </Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_2_UnsentMailReaction_001_Player_001">Huh, I forgot to hit send. Does it matter? I already told him about it.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonTalking_2_SentMailReaction_001_Player_001">Better late then never.</Entry>
    </CATEGORY>
</LANGUAGE>
